SY_TALK("aF3ITtXgyYo",[[735,["Today we are going to worship Shri Krishna as Yogeshwara."]],[747,["As it is, you know that Vishnu’s first incarnation as a human being"]],[759,["was Vamana avatar."]],[763,["And then went till He came as Shri Ram."]],[774,["So, the past of Shri Krishna was Shri Ram."]],[780,["And when Shri Rama came on this earth,"]],[784,["He went into lots of austerities, to go to jungle,"]],[789,["His wife was lost, whom He had to find out."]],[794,["And to establish the benevolent king"]],[800,["on this earth, He was made the king of Ayodhya."]],[813,["But all His life it was a struggle","and austerities which He followed."]],[825,["As a result, the people who followed Shri Ram"]],[828,["became extremely austere."]],[832,["They used to sleep on the grass"]],[838,["because Shri Ram had to sleep on the grass for so many years."]],[843,["They used to wear wooden slippers."]],[849,["They would just wear very little clothes or one dhoti,"]],[855,["just like Shri Rama wore when His wife was out."]],[860,["All these austerities they did to show how a householder should be."]],[870,["He never enjoyed any other life as a man,"]],[877,["but just lived like an ascetic when His wife was lost."]],[888,["All these things were to establish also a very"]],[895,["ideal personality for a man to be attached to His wife."]],[904,["He was a person with Ekapatnivrata, means: one wife."]],[910,["Though She knew She was Mahalakshmi, She was a Goddess,"]],[915,["but still He was forced to do things"]],[926,["because He wanted to show how a benevolent king should be."]],[935,["In the second incarnation of His, when He came as Shri Krishna,"]],[942,["then He had to neutralize","all these austerities He has put on people."]],[1034,["– Ha. So, Shri Krishna came on this earth."]],[1043,["In His childhood He had to also face lots of"]],[1049,["problems which He surpassed,"]],[1055,["and He went and killed His uncle, as you know very well,"]],[1064,["who was a rakshasa."]],[1067,["After doing all this, then He went to Dwarika, which He built"]],[1074,["– now they have found out where is Dwarika"]],[1077,["– and He became the king of Dwarika."]],[1086,["To understand Shri Krishna"]],[1090,["in Sahaja Yoga is much more subtler","than the stories that they tell."]],[1095,["[aside] … move it – better. ?"]],[1101,["The stories are there,"]],[1105,["but behind these stories,"]],[1107,["as being Sahaja Yogis, you have to see the subtle things"]],[1111,["about His incarnation."]],[1116,["So, the first one was, He was Leeladhara,"]],[1122,["means the One who said this is all a play."]],[1127,["That means you have to become a witness."]],[1130,["So, He said that your mind should become just a witness."]],[1137,["At Virata stage He becomes Akbar."]],[1142,["And at that stage He is the mind, the brain of"]],[1151,["the great primordial Being."]],[1154,["So, first He thinks that we have to become witness,"]],[1163,["witness of the drama,"]],[1166,["and we should not get lost into the Maya."]],[1190,["If you are a witness you can see the Maya, how it works."]],[1198,["So the first, first subtle nature","of Shri Krishna was to create a Leela"]],[1207,["to neutralize all the austerities","created by the incarnation of Shri Rama."]],[1215,["But the second great quality"]],[1220,["that He had is also to put the Maya on people."]],[1228,["So, if He is the brain, our brain should become a sakshi,"]],[1235,["should become a witness, witness the play."]],[1240,["You should not take anything as something extremely serious."]],[1247,["When you look at things as sakshi swarupa, as"]],[1251,["something that you are watching a drama,"]],[1254,["you may for the time being feel that you are Napoleon,","you are the one who is acting."]],[1260,["But after some time the play is over,"]],[1263,["you know it’s a play. So, to reach that state, you have to"]],[1269,["become thoughtlessly aware."]],[1275,["Because we think from our brain,"]],[1278,["and this brain goes on thinking, thinking, creating a Maya,"]],[1283,["and playing into Maya."]],[1286,["Now, here it is when you are a realized soul,","you should see through the Maya."]],[1293,["Everything that I am doing or you are doing,"]],[1301,["should be understood very well if you are really"]],[1310,["the reflection of Shri Krishna’s brain."]],[1316,["So, in your brain, there should be no worry,"]],[1321,["there should be no stress, there should be no problem,"]],[1326,["because you are just watching everything"]],[1331,["in thoughtless awareness."]],[1334,["So, when you are thoughtless awareness,"]],[1337,["means when your brain is just in the state of witness,"]],[1344,["you understand everything that is Divine."]],[1350,["I’ll give you an example, just now it happened."]],[1353,["I got into the car and they didn’t know where to go,"]],[1358,["and we went onto wrong road, then I told him ” Go this way “."]],[1363,["So he was wondering ” How Mother knows?” I said ” Vibrations! ”"]],[1370,["Through vibrations I could feel we are ther","– they are all there, sitting there,"]],[1374,["– and we came round."]],[1378,["Unless and untill you are thoughtlessly aware,","you cannot grow, that is first thing."]],[1385,["And secondly, unless and until you are thoughtlessly aware,","you do not know the absolute Truth."]],[1393,["Through your brain only you will know."]],[1397,["You don’t have to put your hands, you don’t have to ask questions."]],[1402,["But it’s like a computer that works, it just gives you an answer."]],[1409,["In that state you are completely one with the Divine,"]],[1412,["and it just gives you an answer,"]],[1416,["and you do that and you are amazed how it has worked out."]],[1421,["Everything, every moment is computerized with Shri Krishna."]],[1427,["But at the same time He tests you,"]],[1432,["He plays His Leela on you. That one must know,"]],[1437,["because He’s a diplomat."]],[1440,["How He has played Leela on you is very interesting to see,"]],[1446,["His style of Leela."]],[1449,["Like He’s told Arjuna"]],[1458,["that ” I will not fight “."]],[1465,["Arjuna said: ” All right, what will you do? ”"]],[1468,["” I’ll be your charioteer,"]],[1472,["I’ll drive your chariot."]],[1474,["” Now it would look funny to anybody: ”","What is this, such a great man"]],[1479,["who calls me as His guru,"]],[1481,["He says that He is the one who,"]],[1484,["I mean, He says that I am the best of His disciples,"]],[1487,["everything, and here He just offers","His services like a charioteer. ”"]],[1495,["In this, He is just trying a trick on Arjuna."]],[1507,["As if He knows the future that’s going to happen."]],[1511,["So, the whole Gita was created because He was just a charioteer,"]],[1519,["because Arjuna said ” I cannot fight my own people,"]],[1524,["I cannot fight my own grandparents,","and I cannot fight my relations. ”"]],[1533,["Now, if you say that Gita is for peace, it is not."]],[1539,["It is not for peace."]],[1542,["But He says that: ” They are already dead, whom are you killing?"]],[1548,["These dead people, if you are killing them what will happen?"]],[1553,["But if you now run away from the battlefield,"]],[1558,["people will call you a coward,"]],[1563,["and what will you get? But if you fight for the religion,"]],[1569,["then you will get your resurrection – moksha.”"]],[1577,["It’s a big trick in all these things."]],[1580,["Same was said by Mohammed Sahib, and same by Christians later,"]],[1586,["same about the Hindus","– that they all feel they are fighting for Dharma."]],[1596,["In Arjuna’s case, it was a clear-cut case"]],[1600,["that somebody was a rakshasa and horrible people,"]],[1604,["they were adharmis, so He was fighting them, it’s all right."]],[1611,["But what about other people when they say that ” We are going to"]],[1617,["die for religion “? I met a Bosnia muslim","who had just somewhere escaped"]],[1625,["and I asked Him ” Why, why do you want to fight?"]],[1629,["Why do you want to fight for land","when you believe in the formless God? ”"]],[1637,["He said: ” It’s written in the Koran that if you fight for religion"]],[1642,["then you will get your moksha.","” Exactly the same Shri Krishna has said."]],[1650,["But where is the mistake?"]],[1653,["The mistake is: what is the Dharma?"]],[1659,["Are you dharmic? Are you in – standing in Dharma?"]],[1667,["Then this fight was in those days, were with weapons."]],[1673,["So, why did Shri Krishna not take a weapon in His hand?"]],[1678,["This is the second. Firstly, nobody has Dharma,"]],[1683,["they’re all adharmis","– they may call themselves hindus, muslims, christians"]],[1687,["– all are adharmis, they don’t follow the religion."]],[1690,["And secondly, they are killing each other only,"]],[1694,["one adharmi killing other adharmi,"]],[1697,["or maybe in between themselves they are fighting: everybody"]],[1700,["is thinking ” I am right and whatever I am doing is the right. ”"]],[1705,["So, the first condition is put that for Dharma you have to fight."]],[1710,["So first, one should find out: are we fighting for Dharma?"]],[1716,["But He was even subtler,"]],[1719,["He didn’t take any weapons in His hands, nothing."]],[1723,["He was just holding the reins of the chariot."]],[1729,["Because Shri Krishna is the mind,"]],[1732,["is the Virat, is the great Mind,","He doesn’t need any weapons or such."]],[1739,["But what He did at that time,"]],[1741,["He used His mind for a very very profound knowledge,"]],[1749,["to explain to Arjuna. Imagine, in the warfield,"]],[1752,["He didn’t make Him sit down","” All right, you are my Shishya, you sit here,"]],[1756,["I am your guru, I’ll tell you. ”"]],[1759,["– nothing. In the battlefield you see,"]],[1763,["when everybody was there to fight","and they were about to start the war,"]],[1770,["He starts telling very patiently to Arjuna, at that time."]],[1780,["Now, what is He doing there? He’s not using any weapons, nothing."]],[1786,["He is being counselling, counselling to Arjuna, telling him."]],[1796,["Now, see His subtle brain."]],[1801,["He introduces in the first chapter only that"]],[1805,["” You have to go higher then what you are. ”"]],[1809,["And then He gives him"]],[1812,["the definition of a person who","is an enlightened person which is a Sthitha Pragya."]],[1819,["I mean, normally, a businessman will start"]],[1823,["from one dollar, then hundred dollars,","you see, the other way round."]],[1827,["But He told him first thing"]],[1830,["that ” You have to become a Sthitha Pragya, otherwise it’s no use.”"]],[1836,["Unless and until you become","Sthitha Pragya you cannot have Dharma,"]],[1841,["this is the point."]],[1843,["To understand Shri Krishna, you have to really have a very"]],[1846,["subtle brain, otherwise you cannot understand."]],[1850,["So, He tells that ” You should"]],[1855,["give up this kind of a morose that has developed in you,"]],[1861,["Kaivalya I will call it."]],[1863,["And what you have to do, now take up the weapon in your hand"]],[1868,["and fight. ”"]],[1874,["So, then, He asked him about other things,"]],[1881,["” What about that: You are here telling me"]],[1885,["that you should become Nishkriya,"]],[1888,["that means “no work”. Your karmas become akarmas."]],[1893,["Now, talking like this,"]],[1895,["and why do you want me to kill these people – that is akarma? ”"]],[1900,["Now, how you see, slowly removes from one point"]],[1904,["that you should fight for Dharma. Now, it’s a very subtle thing:"]],[1908,["are you in Dharma or not, first of all find out?"]],[1912,["You are not, so what Dharma you fight, first?"]],[1918,["Then, the second thing is karma."]],[1923,["Again, see, He is a brainy fellow, the brains of God,"]],[1929,["extremely tricky."]],[1932,["The second trick He plays on Him saying that"]],[1939,["” You are working, all right? But if you are a Sthitha Pragya,"]],[1950,["then you leave all the work at the lotus feet of God ” or Him."]],[1957,["[Hindi phrase, UNCLEAR]"]],[1961,["“Give up all Dharmas and follow Me. ”"]],[1965,["Now what is his Dharma?"]],[1968,["That problem is that people don’t understand Him."]],[1971,["It’s all concentrated on Shri Krishna, and"]],[1975,["His own manifestation."]],[1980,["[aside]"]],[1986,["He says that ” Do your karmas."]],[1990,["But you put them at the lotus feet of the Lord! ”"]],[1995,["– It’s not possible unless and until you are Sthitha Pragya,"]],[2000,["unless and until you are enlightened."]],[2002,["Now, when you are enlightened,","when you have got your realization,"]],[2006,["when you raise your Kundalini or anybody’s Kundalini,"]],[2011,["you don’t say ” Mother, I am giving realization “.","You don’t say that, never."]],[2017,["What you say: ” It is happening “, in third person you talk. ”"]],[2022,["It’s not coming, it’s not working or it’s just moving on the side."]],[2026,["This chakra is catching, that chakra is catching."]],[2029,["” You never say ” I am doing anything “, the ‘I’ is lost."]],[2036,["When that ‘I’ is lost, than only","you will put everything at the lotus feet of God."]],[2044,["So, first, it should be done in Dharma."]],[2047,["Supposing, somebody murders somebody and say ” Oh, I have"]],[2051,["done it now, so it is my karmas","and I put it at the lotus feet of Shri Krishna. ”"]],[2055,["Now, people can, I mean, people have special brains also"]],[2060,["to interprete Shri Krishna and Gita."]],[2064,["But what He said for Dharma you should do it."]],[2068,["So, first of all, you should be","a Sthitha Pragya, means an enlightened person,"]],[2073,["and whatever you do"]],[2075,["automatically goes at the lotus feet of God, automatically,"]],[2080,["spontaneously, Sahaj."]],[2085,["Now, the third thing He did:"]],[2089,["What about bhakti? People said ” What?"]],[2092,["We are doing bhakti to God, this,","that, then what is the reward for this? ”"]],[2097,["There again He plays tricks."]],[2100,["On one word He has made everybody dance, you know?"]],[2105,["He says ” You do bhakti, but it should be Ananya, ”"]],[2110,["– this is the word, Ananya, – when there is not the other,"]],[2115,["means when you have become One with Me,"]],[2120,["means you are a Sthitha Pragya, means you are a realized soul."]],[2126,["Just imagine, on this word if people pay attention,"]],[2131,["they will give up all this nonsense of bhakti"]],[2135,["and will first get their connection when they become Ananya"]],[2141,["and then do the bhakti."]],[2144,["Because Shri Krishna knew human beings very well."]],[2148,["I think, He knew them better than Christ","– definitely"]],[2153,["– because Christ was straightforward."]],[2156,["He said: ” Take out your right eye, throw it away."]],[2159,["Take out your left eye, throw it away."]],[2162,["Cut your hand, throw it away."]],[2164,["” Same with Mohammed Sahib. Who will do that?"]],[2169,["So, Shri Krishna was very clever, He said:"]],[2174,["straightforward they will not understand,"]],[2177,["so give them in such a way that they will go on doing and doing,"]],[2182,["we are doing so much bhakti, so many people come into it.","Even this Ram,"]],[2186,["Hari Ramas, they are developing now throat cancers."]],[2190,["So, they are saying ” Mother, why these throat cancer to us,"]],[2194,["we are saying the name of Sri Krishna?”","” Because you are not connected.”"]],[2200,["Now supposing, I will even want to","meet the president of this country."]],[2205,["I’ll have to go through such a protocol. I may not even meet."]],[2213,["But this One is the God of Gods."]],[2218,["He is the President of all the presidents."]],[2223,["If you have to take His name, if you go and take name of Lincoln,"]],[2228,["of Clinton, and go on saying","” Clinton, Clinton Clinton “, they’ll all arrest Me."]],[2234,["So, if you go on saying ” Rama, Rama, Rama,","Allah, Allah, Allah, Akbar, Akbar, Akbar “, you’ll be arrested."]],[2241,["You have no connection."]],[2245,["So, that Virata Shakti which we call,"]],[2249,["which is of course in Koran described as Akbar,"]],[2256,["this power also plays tricks."]],[2267,["As a Mother, I have to warn you"]],[2272,["that nothing will work out","unless (and) until you are a realized soul."]],[2280,["Nothing will work out. Now, for realization,"]],[2285,["He has said: ” You have to become “."]],[2288,["But He didn’t say at that time"]],[2292,["how you will become, what will work it out."]],[2299,["Because you see, sort of, if you go to college,"]],[2302,["all the knowledge is not given in first year."]],[2305,["Something is given, then something in second year,"]],[2308,["then in third year. Now in the seventh year,","now Sahaja Yoga has come"]],[2313,["to tell you everything, totally."]],[2317,["He is Totality, but He doesn’t give total knowledge."]],[2324,["The whole knowledge of Gita is nothing"]],[2327,["but trick that He has played with human beings who were stupid,"]],[2331,["and would never have understood Him"]],[2333,["if He’d told them about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2336,["Even today I meet many like that, of course,"]],[2340,["but so many He could not have got at that time."]],[2345,["So, they didn’t talk about Kundalini this much, so far,"]],[2351,["and that’s all."]],[2356,["Same with other people."]],[2359,["The kind of disciples they had, the kind of people they had,"]],[2364,["they could not tell them everything about"]],[2370,["their ascent, because they were not ready,"]],[2375,["they were not of that level, their brains were not that developed."]],[2380,["Now in this Kali Yuga, when I am starting this work,"]],[2384,["I find their brains are overdeveloped, over."]],[2389,["And so much so that overdeveloped brains become stupid"]],[2394,["and that’s really. Overuse of anything makes you stupid,"]],[2400,["and they become absolutely stupid."]],[2405,["Now, how can you tell them such a subtle knowledge"]],[2409,["who are stupid people? What is the way?"]],[2415,["If I talk like Shri Krishna"]],[2418,["it would have been just a waste of My energy"]],[2422,["and your energy. Half of you would have gone off to sleep."]],[2426,["So I said, first of all, let Me connect them to Divinity."]],[2432,["If I could connect them to Divinity – little bit even, little bit"]],[2436,["– then they will understand."]],[2438,["Because that will enlighten their brain a little bit,"]],[2442,["and they will know that there’s something more than what we know."]],[2447,["And that’s how it is going to work out."]],[2450,["So the subtle system of trickery of Shri Krishna"]],[2454,["has helped a lot, no doubt, that people are realizing"]],[2457,["that there is something missing in it. Even of Islam"]],[2464,["– Islam means surrender – but surrender to whom? To mullahs"]],[2471,["– or to whom? The problem started when","[Hijak, a name – UNCLEAR] he started like that."]],[2480,["There are mullahs and there are this."]],[2483,["So, the surrender part became"]],[2485,["surrender to these stupid mullahs.","I’ve seen most of them are absolutely stupid."]],[2491,["And they take a cane in their hands in the other, you see"]],[2495,["they beat, even women they beat."]],[2497,["You are supposed to do Pujas five times"]],[2500,["and if you don’t do them, Pujas five times,","they call it silla [UNCLEAR],"]],[2504,["then they beat women. Every shop must be closed five times."]],[2510,["I tell you, they are such hypocritical people naturally,"]],[2516,["because if you are asked to do five times meditation, say,"]],[2521,["you will never do it, but you will just do it out of fear."]],[2524,["Out of fear if you do something, what’s the use?"]],[2529,["Now, whatever Muhammed Sahib has said or Christ has said,"]],[2534,["it is only for angels, I can tell you, not for normal people."]],[2540,["And where are the angels? Very few there are:"]],[2546,["those are born-realized people who have come on this earth"]],[2551,["are angels. And they are told not to do something they will not do."]],[2559,["Most of them know what is right and wrong."]],[2562,["Where are those angels, very few?"]],[2566,["And those who are angels are treated just like, you can call it,"]],[2572,["like packed people or lunatic people, – nobody believes them."]],[2577,["One here and one there and one in some other place."]],[2582,["So this, what they preached was for the angels."]],[2588,["Only the angels could understand."]],[2591,["But Shri Krishna thought that these other people who are there,"]],[2595,["who are not angels, why not trick them?"]],[2599,["Many people come and tell me: ”","We take the name of Krishna every day like this,"]],[2605,["and we haven’t received anything."]],[2608,["” But first He said, ” You have to be Sthitha Pragya. ”"]],[2612,["Sthitha Pragya: ‘Sthitha’ means established,"]],[2618,["‘Pragya’ means enlightened,"]],[2622,["– you should be enlightened personality, absolutely established."]],[2629,["First thing, first thing you see, in a second chapter."]],[2633,["First thing is it. After that He says all these things,"]],[2639,["and that’s why many people have misunderstood Gita."]],[2645,["But His idea was: in one life they’ll misunderstand,"]],[2649,["second life they’ll misunderstand,"]],[2651,["third life they will start thinking ” After all, what is this?”"]],[2655,["First, He has said “You become a Sthitha Pragya”,","we have not become a Sthitha Pragya."]],[2660,["So, what’s wrong with us? ”"]],[2663,["So, some introspection will start."]],[2665,["That was His idea, idea I should say."]],[2669,["But I have seen people","who can give lectures on Gita hours together,"]],[2676,["but their brains are closed completely."]],[2682,["Now, to say that He didn’t say anything about Kundalini is there."]],[2687,["That’s why Gyaneshwara in","the twelvth century took permission from his brother"]],[2694,["who was his guru that ”Allow me, at least, to say about Kundalini.”"]],[2699,["And that is how it was exposed a little bit."]],[2703,["Of course, before that also,"]],[2706,["we have had people like Adi Shankaracharya, the sixth century,"]],[2713,["and before that also Markandeya."]],[2717,["But they talked about the Kundalini,","that’s all, praised the Kundalini."]],[2725,["But that She passes through six centers,","how will It raise and all that."]],[2730,["And not about the future, that this will happen one day."]],[2735,["So many have written, of course."]],[2737,["But I would say that precisely the one who has written"]],[2743,["complete description of Sahaja Yogis even is by Gyaneshwara"]],[2748,["in the poetry called Pasaydan in which","he exactly said what will happen,"]],[2756,["how many people will get realization"]],[2760,["and he said that ” You the people,"]],[2763,["who are the forests of the trees,","boon-giving trees, Kalpakaruna, boon-giving trees,"]],[2777,["you rise and give it to others."]],[2782,["” Then he says that ” You are the oceans who are"]],[2791,["giving ambrosia talks.”"]],[2795,["He has described you in such a beautiful manner"]],[2799,["that you should read the translation of Pasaydan"]],[2803,["and then you will know what you are,"]],[2805,["how you have been praised by him.","And he said that you will loose other relationship"]],[2811,["and the only relationships will be these."]],[2815,["They will be your real relations."]],[2818,["To say all these things, to have such a vision,"]],[2821,["he must be a great incarnation himself."]],[2826,["So, this is how in Gyaneshwari, which is a commentary of Gita,"]],[2836,["he has put in the sixth chapter, now is a commentary on Gita,"]],[2840,["but in the sixth chapter he said how you can get your realization."]],[2846,["About Kundalini, how it will work out."]],[2849,["So, gradually it was all unfolded."]],[2852,["And gradually people also developed"]],[2855,["their spiritual state to understand."]],[2858,["Supposing, I had started Sahaja Yoga even hundred years back,"]],[2862,["I would not have even one single disciple, one single Sahaja Yogi."]],[2867,["The reason was, the people were all right,","they were on value system, all right."]],[2872,["Their life was very much satisfying, they were very peaceful."]],[2876,["They were just interested in some horses or something like that."]],[2879,["But now, you find people are so much disturbed,"]],[2885,["so much in trouble, so much in chaos this in Kali Yuga,"]],[2890,["it’s the height of Kali Yuga now. So much of immorality,"]],[2894,["so much of dissatisfaction in life"]],[2898,["that they have to now think where to go."]],[2903,["Like a shock the future is waiting for them"]],[2907,["and now what should they achieve. So, the whole this"]],[2912,["Bhranti, illusion of life starts staring at them,"]],[2921,["and then they start thinking ” What is this, what am I doing,"]],[2925,["what have I done, why is it so?"]],[2927,["Why everything in a chaos, why is it happening? ”"]],[2932,["Then the seeking starts and with their seeking now,","you know what has happened,"]],[2937,["that you all have got your realization."]],[2939,["Without the seeking it would not","have been even possible for Me to talk to you"]],[2944,["at all about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2946,["It is because you are seekers I can talk to you."]],[2949,["And it has worked out,"]],[2951,["I am very happy that it has worked out in America."]],[2956,["Another quality, is a great quality of Shri Krishna, is that"]],[2961,["He is Gujara [HINDI ?], means"]],[2968,["His element is firmament, what we call Akash,"]],[2972,["and He penetrates into everything."]],[2976,["He penetrates into everything. He penetrates into the"]],[2985,["– what do you call that – anu, renu, paramanu,"]],[2991,["three things – atoms. Into little atoms it goes and it shakes them."]],[3002,["Now, if you ask any scientist, he’ll tell you"]],[3005,["that there is an asymetric, symetric vibrations even in atoms."]],[3012,["Now, how can this energy be existing there?"]],[3017,["Because He can penetrate into anything"]],[3020,["and because of this, He’s so penetrating,"]],[3025,["that He encompasses everything:"]],[3029,["into matter, into animals, into human beings, into realized souls"]],[3038,["He penetrates. In the matter it is just a vibrations,"]],[3045,["in the animals it is just a guiding force,"]],[3048,["it’s tremendous guiding force."]],[3056,["Like birds from Siberia flying down to Australia:"]],[3063,["who gives them the sense of direction?"]],[3066,["We never think about it."]],[3071,["There are so many things animals are doing."]],[3076,["They have such a sense of understanding."]],[3080,["Like a tiger in the, say, in the forest:"]],[3084,["all the animals know that there is a tiger in the forest,"]],[3088,["they are all quiet, respecting their king."]],[3091,["He kills, say one cow or could be some animal,"]],[3097,["they just respect him. The thing what he has killed is left"]],[3103,["for one day, nobody touches it."]],[3106,["See the protocol: now when he comes back next day,"]],[3111,["he eats to his own satisfaction,"]],[3114,["then the tigress, then the children, they eat."]],[3118,["Once they have finished with it,","then one by one, in the order of protocol,"]],[3124,["all the animals eat that animal,"]],[3129,["the last of all are crows"]],[3133,["which are perhaps vegetarians, I should say."]],[3138,["But the protocol is maintained."]],[3145,["If a lion is sitting,"]],[3151,["you can make it out there won’t be even a little sound anywhere."]],[3159,["So, it guides the animals and animals keep their character."]],[3167,["They are not like human beings."]],[3169,["For example, a snake is a snake and a tiger is a tiger."]],[3174,["But human beings can be snake, tiger, leopard"]],[3178,["– anything together."]],[3181,["They might be dogs, they might be","small little worms, they could be anything."]],[3187,["Combinations of so many things,"]],[3189,["because they have passed through","these Yonis, as they call them, these species."]],[3194,["So, all these kinds of combinations, permutations,","combinations inside of the past is existing."]],[3204,["And if somebody can take you to your subconscious,","I have seen this,"]],[3209,["people start barking like a dog,"]],[3212,["and sometimes they behave like tigers, this can happen."]],[3220,["All this is within us, the past,"]],[3223,["with all these complicated personalities."]],[3228,["Some are like owls, always very serious, you know, hawk-like,"]],[3236,["some are like chirping birds."]],[3240,["But there are so many combinations they have in them,"]],[3244,["that it is very difficult, you know,"]],[3248,["to make them little straightforward."]],[3254,["They are so much entangled. First to remove all the entanglement."]],[3260,["And then to raise the Kundalini."]],[3263,["The best part of the organization is, which is made,"]],[3268,["that consciousness is vertically placed."]],[3273,["Subconscious and Supraconscious sort."]],[3276,["Supraconscious righthandside of yours"]],[3279,["and the Subconscious lefthandside of yours."]],[3284,["And in the central the path is left on. This is the Sushumna path."]],[3289,["It is the Mahalakshmi’s path."]],[3292,["It is the path, which leads you to the state of Virat,"]],[3297,["to the state of your brain."]],[3303,["So now, the combination of three things work out."]],[3309,["The brain is the Virat, heart is Shiva,"]],[3314,["and the liver is Brahmadeva."]],[3320,["All these three powers are there."]],[3328,["But at that time, when you are realized,"]],[3332,["then your brain surrenders to Shiva,"]],[3336,["to the principle of Shiva, that is the Spirit."]],[3341,["Brain is surrendered, surrendered not by force or anything,"]],[3347,["but to absorb the power of the Spirit,"]],[3352,["the brain gets surrendered completely to the Spirit,"]],[3358,["so that the Spirit enlightens the brain."]],[3362,["It is the enlightenment of the brain"]],[3367,["that gives you all this subtle understanding."]],[3374,["It is to make your brain understand,"]],[3378,["there are so many blissful happenings, people are blessed:"]],[3384,["once, twice, thrice – then they are surprised,","the brain starts thinking."]],[3391,["”How did I get this blessing, how did it happen to me,"]],[3394,["how could I get my transformation?” So slowly-slowly"]],[3401,["they start trusting their heart,","means they start trusting their Spirit,"]],[3407,["they start trusting their devotion."]],[3414,["And this is how the bhakti is absolutely"]],[3421,["done without any desire, without any asking,"]],[3426,["without any obligation, just in oneness."]],[3430,["Because the brain joins hands with the heart, we can say."]],[3437,["Now, also the Brahmadeva becomes surrendered."]],[3445,["As a result, what happens:","that your liver is surrendered to your brain."]],[3455,["When this happens – when your liver is surrendered to your brain"]],[3461,["– whatever you do is all enlightened work."]],[3466,["Whatever you do: whether you sing,"]],[3470,["whether you’re a government servant, whether anything"]],[3473,["– whatever you do with your brain, anything"]],[3477,["through the Swadishthana"]],[3479,["or through the Brahmadeva, it is an enlightened work."]],[3497,["As it is the brain which is enlightened,"]],[3501,["which is connected with this All Pervading Power,"]],[3505,["whatever you are doing, whatever your ideas are,"]],[3512,["being absolutely enlightened means that you achieve them."]],[3522,["Enlightened brain, whatever it thinks,"]],[3526,["it is thinking as well as achieving – both together."]],[3533,["It’s a thing to be understood that an enlightened person"]],[3540,["has the power to achieve anything."]],[3547,["But at the same time his desires would be Divine."]],[3553,["Like the other day we had very few people say in Saritos,"]],[3558,["so all the Sahaja Yogis were extremely unhappy"]],[3563,["as if somebody has died in their family and worse than that."]],[3568,["Why? Because this was their own work,"]],[3574,["which they could not understand why this enlightened mind of theirs"]],[3582,["could not produce the result, achieve the results."]],[3587,["And they felt extremely unhappy."]],[3590,["This shows what identification there is for the spiritual work,"]],[3598,["or Divine work and their own lives."]],[3601,["To them this is the most important."]],[3604,["And everybody is not like that, of course."]],[3607,["For some people, something else is more important."]],[3610,["They may use Sahaja Yoga for their own well-being or anything."]],[3615,["But those who just think of Sahaja Yoga"]],[3619,["– that’s again the brain which is enlightened. They achieve it."]],[3625,["But it should not have any selfish motive behind it."]],[3629,["It should not have any hatred behind it or anything,"]],[3636,["or for some sort of a publicity or some."]],[3641,["But if it is just the thinking about the Sahaja Yoga work,"]],[3648,["it will be achieved, it will be achieved."]],[3651,["One should never feel frustrated."]],[3654,["That’s what is said, that God is with you,"]],[3657,["He is your shepherd."]],[3659,["And this is what happens when you become"]],[3665,["a surrendered lamb under the guide of this shepherd."]],[3675,["Then as a result of this brain becoming enlightened,","you start having faith in yourself."]],[3685,["Nirvikalpa, you become doubtlessly aware."]],[3688,["As soon as you become, I mean the brain becomes doubtless."]],[3692,["It’s the brain that thinks,","it’s the brain that doubts, it’s the brain"]],[3696,["that creates all conditionings, the brain that creates ego"]],[3701,["– one instrument doing all this nonsense. Hatred it will create,"]],[3707,["it will justify nonsense, it will criticize others,"]],[3713,["it will hate others, it will make fun of others."]],[3720,["That is not the quality of Shri Krishna,"]],[3724,["because He is the collective."]],[3730,["That’s why He never said: ” You are a sinner ”","or anything like that."]],[3737,["He didn’t criticize anyone."]],[3742,["After all, I have to criticize, He did not."]],[3747,["Now, if there was Kamsa, all right, kill him, finished."]],[3751,["There are Sanda, kill him."]],[3753,["Any rakshasa, Narakasura, kill him,"]],[3757,["finished, no argument., nothing.","”I have no time for this nonsense. Finish him.”"]],[3763,["Straightforward."]],[3766,["What is the use of criticizing anyone,"]],[3769,["just kill them. That was as straightforward."]],[3775,["But by killing them, they again come back in this Kali Yuga."]],[3782,["So the best thing is to detach people from him,"]],[3787,["from these rakshasas where they are lost."]],[3791,["That’s the best way. Now,","one way could be that I put it in your brains"]],[3798,["that this is a rakshas. But they won’t believe Me, they won’t."]],[3805,["So, what happens when you go to them,"]],[3808,["you get all the kinks in your head."]],[3813,["You start getting pins and needles on your fingertips."]],[3818,["This is all the activity of brain that it acts on your nerves,"]],[3822,["and you can feel it."]],[3824,["You start shaking. The other day somebody came and sat before","Me for news just doing like this. ” What is this – Stop it! ”"]],[3829,["” So I can’t, I can’t, I can’t “, he was going on.","I wasn’t doing anything to him, it’s the brain."]],[3836,["In My presence, the brain acts."]],[3842,["Because as I told you, He penetrates into anything,"]],[3845,["if I put my glance at somebody."]],[3849,["The other day,"]],[3850,["there was a boy, very naughty, beats people,","he bites them, these things like that, very crazy."]],[3856,["As soon as he saw Me ran away."]],[3859,["He attacks every person but he ran away."]],[3863,["Then you have seen people who are possessed, what happens to them?"]],[3867,["Just like this, they come to Me, they shake,"]],[3870,["they – sometimes I only worry that they should not faint"]],[3873,["in My presence in the programme, otherwise it’s a headache."]],[3878,["So, who acts in them, who acts on these people who are possessed,"]],[3884,["who makes all these gestures – is the brain."]],[3888,["In the brain they have got"]],[3892,["these problems and Shri Krishna makes them shake."]],[3897,["It’s the tremors that they feel,","the pins and needles that they feel,"]],[3902,["the heat that they feel – all this is central nervous system,"]],[3908,["run by brain."]],[3910,["So, after enlightenment, what happens that the brain is at peace,"]],[3920,["absolutely at peace with itself."]],[3924,["It doesn’t react as it used to react."]],[3929,["Like I’ve seen people here so speedy, so nervous,"]],[3936,["so upset all the time, so jittery, irritable."]],[3939,["I was reading the life of Mao and I was surprised:"]],[3943,["his physician, personal physician has said even."]],[3947,["Absolutely like a tyrant and he","used to keep up the faces very well."]],[3953,["But according to this doctor, he was a cruelest man he had known."]],[3960,["This is Mao,"]],[3963,["who obviously looked to be a very great reformer,","he did so much for that country, this thing."]],[3970,["But no, he was a hypocrite. How will you know"]],[3974,["somebody is a hypocrite or not – with your brain?"]],[3978,["Only if you are enlightened."]],[3981,["So, if Shri Krishna penetrates into your brain,"]],[3986,["then you become an enlightened person, Sthitha Pragya,"]],[3991,["and you become knowledgeable, you know everything,"]],[3999,["whatever is necessary."]],[4001,["You may not know who is number one Wimbledon, maybe."]],[4008,["You may not know who is the actress, what is her life, you may not."]],[4013,["You may not know who is the president","of such and such place, maybe."]],[4020,["But you will know whatever is necessary for you to know."]],[4026,["Otherwise people waste their energies."]],[4029,["I know of somebody who knew the telephone numbers"]],[4036,["and the car numbers of two thousand people. What is the need?"]],[4047,["Something like that,","all these stupid things is a waste of mental energy."]],[4056,["But a Sthitha Pragya does not, he is concentrated"]],[4061,["onto his own knowledge, onto the Divine understanding."]],[4075,["He works really like a computer, and such an efficient computer."]],[4089,["Today I just started talking about Kabira."]],[4092,["Immediately they said ”Mother, vibrations!”"]],[4097,["Taking the name of Kabira you get vibrations."]],[4103,["But to a normal person nothing, Kabira is nothing, another"]],[4109,["romantic fellow."]],[4111,["If they don’t want to understand something, they can say anything."]],[4118,["But only the people who are enlightened,"]],[4122,["their nervous system is so charged"]],[4127,["that they can feel what is wrong, what is right, they can feel"]],[4134,["the Divinity, they can make out"]],[4137,["who are incarnations and who were not."]],[4143,["You don’t know what has happened to","your nervous system: a new dimension has come."]],[4150,["Absolutely a new dimension in your nervous system has come,"]],[4155,["which is manifesting, and this is also","the blessings of Shri Krishna."]],[4163,["Because He is collectiveness within us,"]],[4168,["in the form of collectivity He works."]],[4181,["Unless and until this America is put right,"]],[4185,["Shri Krishna is not going to leave my throat, I tell you."]],[4193,["So, as America, I say, is the","place of Shri Krishna’s auspiciousness."]],[4207,["So, one has to understand what is Shri Krishna’s auspiciousness is."]],[4214,["They said He had 16.000 wives,"]],[4218,["these were His powers, 16.000 powers He has."]],[4224,["And to work out His incarnation He wanted them."]],[4227,["So, they came on this earth as princesses","and was married by a horrible"]],[4234,["king who married them and kept them in the jail."]],[4241,["So, He fought that king and got","them out of them and He married them."]],[4248,["It’s the best part of it: He married them. Because, you see,"]],[4254,["with a man, whatever may be his age,"]],[4257,["if he has 16.000 women around him,"]],[4261,["people will never understand that he is Yogeshwara."]],[4265,["Men have this problem. Not the women so much."]],[4270,["Because women become mothers, you see,","I’m a Mother, nobody can challenge my character."]],[4277,["Because I am a Mother. But the fatherhood can be challenged."]],[4283,["So He married them."]],[4284,["Then the essence of the five elements He married,"]],[4288,["as five wives."]],[4293,["But His real sense of morality is seen in the case of Draupadi."]],[4304,["You know the story of Mahabharata,"]],[4307,["when She was brought in the court of Duryodhana"]],[4313,["(who) asked Dushasana to take out Her saris."]],[4320,["At that time Tulsidas’s written what happened."]],[4325,["She was holding Her saree by Her teeth."]],[4332,["She called ” Krishna “, She could only say ” Kri “,"]],[4336,["‘shna’ means full stop, goes wrong."]],[4339,["She is holding on with only ‘Kri’, and wouldn’t say ‘shna’."]],[4343,["But as soon as She said ” Krishna “, the saree fell down."]],[4349,["Then He describes:"]],[4351,["“Dwarika yashoda jayo yashoda bhayo bari"]],[4354,["shankha chakra gada padma garuda laisi dhary.”"]],[4359,["[Unsure. In Shri Krishna Gitavali of Tulsidas ]"]],[4361,["What did He do?"]],[4362,["When She just said “Krishna”, there was a big sound in Dwarika,"]],[4370,["He was in Dwarika."]],[4375,["Immediately,"]],[4377,["with “shanka, chakra, gada, padma” – these are His four weapons"]],[4384,["– He came on the Garuda."]],[4387,["The way it is said is tremendous,","I mean, I feel really, it fulfils your heart with such"]],[4394,["understanding of Shri Krishna. For his own sister,"]],[4400,["He came all the way to save Her chastity."]],[4406,["To Him the chastity of His sister was of the greatest importance."]],[4412,["He could have said: ” No, no, no,"]],[4415,["I am a king, I have to look after this,","I have to do that, I have to ” – nothing."]],[4421,["If Her chastity is in danger,"]],[4423,["He came flying on the Garuda and supplied that."]],[4428,["And this fellow got tired"]],[4430,["pulling out Her saris. I think, he must have borrowed saris from Me"]],[4434,["because I have too many saris."]],[4437,["One after the other, one after the other,"]],[4440,["he made a pile of saris and he got tired."]],[4443,["He could not make Her nude."]],[4447,["The chastity of Draupadi was of such a height."]],[4454,["And how Shri Krishna tried to save it is remarkable."]],[4464,["So, this Yogeshwara Shri Krishna is also a Dhanvantari,"]],[4472,["means the doctor of doctors."]],[4477,["He is the One who cures. You see, because it’s all the brain"]],[4483,["– and the vibrations which flow on the nervous system."]],[4488,["So, He cures people through His brain."]],[4498,["Now, how? Say now, supposing somebody is having a problem, say"]],[4507,["on his heart. So as soon as he puts hands to My photograph,"]],[4517,["so immediately he gets problem on his left finger here."]],[4523,["The brain is working."]],[4526,["So in your brain, My vibrations go of Shri Krishna"]],[4535,["and they start sending these messages."]],[4541,["Because I am also Shri Krishna."]],[4543,["So this computer acts and immediately"]],[4547,["you know what’s wrong with that person is, he is a heart patient."]],[4553,["You don’t have to do any diagnosis, you don’t have to do anything."]],[4557,["Immediately you know. And who does this, it’s the"]],[4560,["principle of Shri Krishna in the brain of the Virat."]],[4565,["See this, also working for some people, I think."]],[4570,["Now you are convinced about it, you know that it"]],[4574,["works, it acts like this, it happens like that,"]],[4579,["and how it communicates through you."]],[4584,["So, this computer of Mine communicates."]],[4590,["Now, in a computer if you go,"]],[4592,["you can just press the button, of course they are all man-made,"]],[4595,["but whatever it is you then get the result."]],[4598,["Here it is not like that. It is the","brain automatically gives the result,"]],[4607,["immediately, through the other person."]],[4614,["And also the same brain tells you what is to be done"]],[4620,["to such and such person, how to work it out."]],[4623,["The same brain is emitting vibrations,"]],[4628,["and those vibrations are flowing through this brain,"]],[4635,["and they are the ones who tell you what’s wrong with this person."]],[4645,["So, all this work of penetration is done by Shri Krishna, no doubt."]],[4655,["He takes these vibrations, puts into another brain,"]],[4659,["and then that brain, that central nervous system starts working"]],[4664,["and then you get the result. But instantaneously,"]],[4668,["it’s not so much time it takes, another way I have described it,"]],[4672,["it just works immediately."]],[4674,["As soon as they put their hands before Me, immediately!"]],[4682,["So how important it is for us to look after our brain,","for Sahaja Yogis."]],[4691,["I don’t know in this America how far this brain is safe."]],[4697,["Because if you open any television, wah wah wah,"]],[4702,["you look outside on the street,"]],[4705,["look out for the – some advertisements"]],[4709,["and you hear this music"]],[4712,["– it breaks your brain completely."]],[4717,["Whole atmosphere is anti-Shri Krishna."]],[4726,["No purity of understanding, no sense of morality."]],[4735,["The way they make pictures, things, horrible violence, horrible,"]],[4742,["I should say, immoral scenes, all sorts of things"]],[4746,["– all created here in the land of Shri Krishna."]],[4751,["The One who through His waves can completely purify,"]],[4762,["because He’s Yogeshwara, because He is detached,"]],[4770,["absolutely detached, He cannot get attached to anything."]],[4777,["Only the brain makes you attached."]],[4780,["Now see, supposing this carpet is here."]],[4783,["This is a saree, is here."]],[4786,["I look at the saree, and what a nice is this one now."]],[4790,["Now, if it is mine, I’m worried it should not get spoiled"]],[4795,["and where it will be kept, what will happen to it."]],[4801,["Goes on worrying about things. Here is any"]],[4810,["more road you walk, there are","shops, shops, shops, shops, shops, shops, shops."]],[4817,["– Attention goes there, and in that attention"]],[4823,["this brain gets involved completely."]],[4827,["It gets involved, it wants this, and wants that,","and wants that, and wants that -for what?"]],[4837,["So, the detachment from the matter is only possible"]],[4843,["if you know generosity."]],[4849,["But many people are in Sahaja Yoga, but they are not."]],[4853,["What is generosity now?"]],[4857,["Generosity is now if you like My saree, you’ll have it."]],[4862,["That’s the real generosity."]],[4867,["Whatever I am buying is for you, supposing. So you have it."]],[4874,["If you have a generous detached temperament,"]],[4879,["then you can never get involved with matter."]],[4884,["And whatever you are involved, it is love."]],[4888,["Say, I went to Russia,"]],[4893,["and there was nice fish eggs they call as caviar."]],[4902,["There’s one doctor who likes it very much in London."]],[4905,["I said: ” Please, let Me have some “."]],[4908,["They said: ” Why do you want to take this one? ” ” I want to “."]],[4912,["They thought of the doctor who needed it there"]],[4914,["who likes it very much and I felt very happy about that."]],[4918,["And the doctor also was very happy:"]],[4920,["” Mother, you remember even such small thing like this?"]],[4927,["So, the matter has a sense of giving","very great joy to another person."]],[4935,["If you do it with love, again, I say: ” Do it with love “,"]],[4940,["not with attachment, but with love which is detached."]],[4948,["He’s the One who is detached."]],[4957,["So, what is the love that is detached, I’ve told many a times:"]],[4966,["Like the sap in the tree rises, goes to every part of the tree"]],[4973,["and is not attached to any part."]],[4977,["And if it gets attached,"]],[4981,["then the tree will die, and that fruit,","whatever it is, will die also."]],[4988,["So, what is it a detached love is?"]],[4991,["Detached love is the most beautiful thing."]],[4996,["Firstly, by detached love you know what to give to whom,"]],[5003,["what will make people happy, what will make them joyous,"]],[5009,["what do they like."]],[5012,["– In love only you know these things, – what do they like,"]],[5015,["what is their colour, style, what they want. Little, little things."]],[5026,["As I told you yesterday the story of Shri Rama,"]],[5030,["whatever is done with love, even a little thing that you know"]],[5038,["you would like, I would like to purchase, may look stupid."]],[5042,["But I know you like it, so I’ll buy that."]],[5047,["In the same way, you also do that."]],[5051,["All the time you think ” Mother, what will She like?”"]],[5054,["So, you look for little things here and there."]],[5060,["But this detachment has to be full and complete."]],[5066,["Then only you really get people attached to you,","otherwise you cannot."]],[5071,["If you are not detached, you cannot get"]],[5076,["that complete love for another person."]],[5079,["Because if you are doing something, say, for money,"]],[5085,["or if you are doing something for lust,"]],[5089,["or for greed, or for some sort of a position, it has no meaning."]],[5096,["People know","”Oh, I know why he is doing it, because I am such and such“."]],[5103,["In Sahaja Yoga also many people come either to make money,"]],[5108,["either to get cured, all kinds of things."]],[5112,["But if you are detached,"]],[5117,["then only Sahaja Yoga will spread."]],[5122,["As long as there are attachments,","you should know that you are not yet a Sahaja Yogi."]],[5129,["I am not saying ”You take out your eye or cut your hands”","I didn’t say that, to that extent."]],[5136,["What I’m saying: you should introspect and see:"]],[5140,["”How much am I attached to this or to that,"]],[5144,["and why am I so much attached, what does it matter?”"]],[5150,["Always, as a result of attachment"]],[5152,["you’ll always find disappointments."]],[5155,["I’ve seen parents who have doted on","their child, loved their child, this, that."]],[5161,["Children mostly go astray."]],[5167,["But if you have a detached love for your child,"]],[5171,["you do nice things for the child."]],[5175,["At the same time, you know when to say ‘no’,","when it is not good. ” This I don’t like, don’t do it “,"]],[5182,["you must say that."]],[5188,["But detachment is even wider than that."]],[5193,["Like some people are very fond of food."]],[5199,["So,"]],[5202,["to say that you be detached from food is very difficult for them."]],[5207,["Specially, at a certain age, I think, they are very fond of good"]],[5212,["food and all that. Gandhiji has talked about Aswad:"]],[5217,["you should not have any taste."]],[5219,["But as you grow in Sahaja Yoga,","you’ll find automatically it will happen."]],[5226,["All your fascination about food will drop out."]],[5231,["That is another sign that you are absolutely detached about food."]],[5235,["Now, today I had My lunch,","I don’t know whether it is dinner or lunch,"]],[5240,["’cause I had it at about five o’clock,"]],[5243,["so I don’t know wich part of the day it is."]],[5246,["And if I don’t eat, it also makes no difference to Me,"]],[5251,["it doesn’t make Me weak or in any way unhappy."]],[5257,["But thinking about food is just spoiling your brain."]],[5264,["Many people just think about food."]],[5266,["We went to their house: ” Oh, they had made such nice things."]],[5270,["“We went to this house ” They’ve made such nice things.”"]],[5273,["What’s the use? You already have eaten, finished, now, done."]],[5277,["Now, why are you thinking about that?"]],[5280,["Or: ” I went to somebody’s house,","they had given me a horrible food."]],[5286,["” Why to think of food, I still don’t understand."]],[5289,["Whatever has happened has happened."]],[5292,["By thinking you cannot get back what you have been eating,"]],[5296,["or what you are going to eat."]],[5298,["It’s there, whatever is there you have to eat, you see,","what can you do?"]],[5303,["For example, today, they asked Me:","”Mother, will you have hot dog?\""]],[5307,["In Hindi language it means real hot dog – means:"]],[5312,["garam kupte – they call that."]],[5316,["I said ” All right, I’ll have it “."]],[5319,["They said ” All the Americans eat. ”","” All right, I am an american, give Me “."]],[5326,["But when you know something will not","do good for your teeth or something, you should not eat."]],[5331,["For example, the beef is very bad for the teeth, very bad."]],[5335,["That’s why you people loose your teeth very fast."]],[5338,["Many people ask Me in the interview ”","Are your denture your own? ” I said: ” Of course, Mine “."]],[5344,["They can’t believe it’s Mine."]],[5347,["Because I know what not to eat for the teeth’s sake."]],[5353,["But one should not be attached to an idea,"]],[5357,["that’s even subtler attachments."]],[5360,["That has really killed this world with so many problems of"]],[5363,["fanaticism, racialism, I don’t know what."]],[5368,["Now, here, see the contradictions people have:"]],[5372,["they go to the sea to get darker, and they have racialism."]],[5377,["Why do you go to the sea?"]],[5379,["If you go to become darker,"]],[5382,["then why do you hate the people who are dark?"]],[5387,["Such a contradiction because the brain is not in balance."]],[5392,["And for that you have racialism,"]],[5397,["you become racist."]],[5399,["If not that, you have another conditioning that"]],[5404,["there are different casts and according to the cast,","you should go, in India."]],[5410,["How can there be any cast when everybody","has the Spirit in their heart."]],[5416,["They won’t eat from another lower cast,","they are higher cast, this, that."]],[5422,["This brain is the one which creates all kinds of conditionings,"]],[5427,["and all those great Saints who have lived on this earth,"]],[5431,["wether they were in India or abroad or anywhere,"]],[5434,["all of them have stood against this nonsense of discrimination."]],[5440,["That comes from brain, you know, ask them"]],[5443,["” Why do you think like that, you are higher than others? ”"]],[5448,["Like the germans think they are the highest race."]],[5451,["Now, who will believe that bull story, I don’t know?"]],[5453,["It is absolutely nonsensical story:"]],[5456,["germans, the ones who have killed children in the gas chamber"]],[5461,["and enjoyed that, they must be the lowest race ever going!"]],[5468,["But they think they are the highest race! How can they be?"]],[5473,["Tomorrow, Rwanda people will say: ” We are the highest race,"]],[5476,["because we can kill each other nicely in the open. ”"]],[5483,["So, to think yourself to be higher than others,"]],[5487,["to think that you’re more beautiful than others, others are ugly"]],[5494,["– all this is the brain which takes you to ego,"]],[5501,["and the ego is the one who befools you completely all the time."]],[5507,["That’s the job of Shri Krishna."]],[5510,["The story you must have heard about Narada"]],[5513,["who never wanted to see, who thought he was a great man"]],[5517,["because he was never attracted to a woman,","and he was challenging even Shiva."]],[5523,["Then Shri Krishna played a trick on him, He always plays tricks."]],[5528,["He sent two Gandharvas to tease him."]],[5534,["They went down and they asked Narada. They said"]],[5537,["” You are such a beautiful man, such a handsome person,"]],[5541,["there is a marriage going on of a lady [Rupoghadi, UNCLEAR]"]],[5545,["she is very beautiful, she is a princess"]],[5547,["and why don’t you go there, she’ll definitely marry you."]],[5550,["” And they pampered his ego, you see,","such a lot, he started floating in the air."]],[5556,["And he said ”All right, I am going to go there, I am so handsome.”"]],[5560,["Ego. He went there, and this princess came out with a garland."]],[5567,["She looked at him and she giggled first and then she laughed aloud"]],[5572,["and then she went away."]],[5574,["He couldn’t understand, looked at these two persons,"]],[5577,["they said ”It’s all right, now, it doesn’t matter,","maybe somebody is better looking, then you.”"]],[5583,["So, Narada was very angry, he went to the lake."]],[5588,["When he looked into the lake, his face was like a monkey."]],[5594,["He’s become a monkey because this ego makes you a monkey."]],[5600,["And you start thinking: ah, you are great,","you are very beautiful, you are this thing, that thing…"]],[5606,["But you are not."]],[5608,["Because if you are, you won’t think."]],[5612,["Whatever you are, you don’t think about it. You don’t think:","”I am a human being“, do you say that?"]],[5619,["Or do you say ” I have no tails “, do you boast of that?"]],[5623,["Whatever you are not, then you boast: ” I am very beautiful,"]],[5627,["I am very good looking, others are ugly, this thing “."]],[5631,["Then Shri Krishna plays a part through the Maya,"]],[5636,["and He gives a big lesson to that person."]],[5642,["It happens."]],[5644,["So, never think that you are something great,"]],[5648,["or you have achieved this in life and achieved that in life,"]],[5654,["and that you are something a big Johnny."]],[5659,["Nothing, it’s nothing but the ego that has moved on here"]],[5667,["and giving you these ideas, from the ego."]],[5670,["And if you go even further with it,"]],[5673,["then Hitler may enter into your ego and you might behave like him."]],[5680,["Or if you are conditioned, impossible to tell you anything."]],[5686,["Like this Hari Rama fellow I told you","”Why do you wear dhoti in this cold weather?”"]],[5691,["He said ” My guru has told me to wear dhoti “."]],[5694,["”So what sort of a guru is it,"]],[5696,["that he makes you feel cold. I mean, I am a Mother,"]],[5699,["I don’t like all this nonsense.”"]],[5701,["He said ” No, but my guru has said “."]],[5704,["What a conditioning! And conditioning"]],[5708,["for something which is absolutely absurd and ridiculous."]],[5714,["Now see, Americans are most vulnerable to such a thing."]],[5720,["You start any nonsense,"]],[5723,["immediately the Americans are the first to jump on it, immediately."]],[5726,["Drugs you start, you start some sort of a,"]],[5733,["I can say, fancy dress."]],[5737,["It will start in Paris but will be sold in America."]],[5742,["Immediately. There are on the look-out of something new."]],[5746,["It might be a monkey trick, but they will do it."]],[5750,["I don’t know why Americans who are the residents of"]],[5756,["Shri Krishna’s land have no discretion at all,"]],[5763,["what to accept, what not to accept."]],[5766,["They are the worst, they are worse than children even,"]],[5770,["there is no maturity of any kind: ” What’s wrong? ”"]],[5778,["So, the discretion which is the center we have here of Hamsa"]],[5784,["which is ruled by Vishuddhi, is completely sometimes blocked."]],[5794,["Like one lady who came to America told Me very boastfully: ”"]],[5800,["Have you been to the pubs in England? ” I said ” No."]],[5805,["Why? ” ” Oh, my God, what pubs you have here! You know,"]],[5810,["I went to the best ” I said ” Which one? ”"]],[5813,["“It’s known as Hermit’s pub ”"]],[5817,["” What is so special? ” Very high class lady, very high class"]],[5822,["– she says: ” You see, one man died,"]],[5825,["for one month nobody lifted the body,"]],[5828,["the whole thing was filled with the stink."]],[5831,["So the stink is preserved"]],[5833,["and even the cowwebs are preserved as they are there."]],[5836,["Such a great thing was this: in,"]],[5839,["when I went, and really I felt so spiritual there?"]],[5848,["” Then she started boasting ” You see, we are free people."]],[5852,["I allow my children to drink. I give them drinks."]],[5859,["” I said: ” Really? ” ” Yeah, I can give them any alcohol, anyone."]],[5863,["I do not say ‘not this, not that’ – no, they can have “."]],[5867,["The children who were hardly twelve and forteen years of age."]],[5872,["I said ” All right, if you have been doing that,"]],[5877,["what can I say? You are a great lady,"]],[5880,["I would not do to my children or to my grandchildren,","but you are great, namaskar “."]],[5886,["After three, four months, we heard"]],[5889,["that there was a birthday party of the younger boy"]],[5892,["and she had given all these alcohols to them for the friends."]],[5898,["God knows what happened – they had candles and this and that"]],[5901,["– the whole house got burnt and all the children, her sons"]],[5909,["and these two sleeping upstairs, all got burnt and died."]],[5918,["Boasting about nonsense,"]],[5922,["like: ” I have had five hundred men with me “."]],[5927,["Another will say: ” I have so many women. ”"]],[5930,["I mean, you are stupid fools because you are organizing"]],[5937,["nice way to go to hell, and you are all going to go to hell,"]],[5942,["this is what it is to be told to them. If you go on like this,"]],[5947,["what will happen to you?"]],[5949,["Accumulating everything that will destroy them,"]],[5953,["doing everything that will destroy.","” Oh that’s good!” I said ” Why? ”"]],[5958,["” You know, if you take that, then in two minutes you go off. ”"]],[5965,["I said: ” To where? To hell, or where? “."]],[5970,["Anything that is destructive,","I don’t know why the Americans should accept it,"]],[5975,["when they have Shri Krisna as their Lord."]],[5982,["It is to be understood by Sahaja Yogis also,"]],[5986,["that you have to really transform","you have to serve to such an extent"]],[5990,["that what it is, whatever is destructive should be given up."]],[5997,["First of all,"]],[5999,["I find some men and ladies with such long faces, you know."]],[6005,["How can you be? You are living in the country of Leeladhara."]],[6011,["He is the One who made everybody dance,"]],[6014,["and He is the One who sprayed Ras, Ra is energy, Dha is with"]],[6020,["– Ra-Dha. Ra is energy, the One who sustains energy."]],[6025,["The One who did the mental energy enlightened and to sustain it,"]],[6032,["how can you people take to adharma,"]],[6037,["to immorality, and to destruction, I just can’t understand."]],[6047,["I don’t know what are His plans are, very well,"]],[6052,["but He has to really save people of America from"]],[6057,["all kinds of nonsense they do morning till evening."]],[6063,["There’s nobody who is sensible in the politics,"]],[6068,["nobody who has a good character at a very high positions,"]],[6073,["what sort of things! You cannot get one man"]],[6077,["whom you can say he is all right","and he will do good to your nation."]],[6084,["Criticizing others, they are very good."]],[6087,["Like we had this plague, this thing not much"]],[6090,["– this little bit came out,","they have published it all over these media,"]],[6096,["they’ve stopped all our ships,","stopped all our aeroplanes, made such a fuss,"]],[6101,["put us into so much trouble – what about your AIDS,"]],[6104,["which you are giving Prasad everywhere."]],[6110,["It’s very surprising that with your brain","enlightened by Shri Krishna,"]],[6117,["how could people accept even mentally"]],[6121,["– person like Freud. How could you accept Freud?"]],[6126,["I just can’t understand."]],[6129,["And now you are all ruined. So, now we are worried."]],[6133,["They don’t what to do. Now they are breaking families,"]],[6136,["and all the logical conclusions","they reach is just the opposite of Shri Krishna."]],[6141,["Like this Simpson killed his wife."]],[6143,["All right, he killed, finished, this Simpson business."]],[6146,["Now they are coming out big theories, see now: why psychologically"]],[6151,["he killed, because he was married to her."]],[6154,["When you marry only you kill your wife or your husband."]],[6158,["– So, you should not marry: what a conclusion!"]],[6162,["Tomorrow they’ll say that people are killing each other,"]],[6165,["so allow them to have weapons in their hand."]],[6168,["Now, they want to allow them to have some drugs also."]],[6173,["Allow them to have homosexuality, allow them to have all this."]],[6178,["Because, I think, these people in charge of affairs"]],[6183,["do not want anybody to live,"]],[6188,["think that ” Let them fight among themselves, do what they like,"]],[6191,["we should have our own seats. ”"]],[6193,["The way they are not worried about the immorality"]],[6197,["and all the destructive forces","that are acting on American children,"]],[6204,["american youth and american people, not bothered about them."]],[6212,["So, tonight we are praising Shri Krishna who is Yogeshwara."]],[6226,["He eats but He does not eat. He sleeps but He does not sleep."]],[6233,["He has wives but He has no wife. Like this is the Yogeshwara,"]],[6243,["and that is what you are Yogis, and He is your Ishwara,"]],[6246,["so, you have to try to be like Him."]],[6249,["Let your brain be enlightened by His blessings."]],[6254,["And you’ll become that great personality","that encompasses everything,"]],[6260,["that sees everything, that gives you discretion,"]],[6264,["that makes you understand what’s wrong."]],[6267,["And you feel enthousiastic about changing this America"]],[6273,["with all your efforts, with all the mind."]],[6277,["That’s the most important thing you have to do."]],[6280,["As it is, He is a Kubera, He is the Lord of Wealth"]],[6288,["and He has given you such a lot of"]],[6291,["wealth all around, you see, just very near"]],[6294,["New York, you should have such a beautiful places."]],[6298,["In every way, you are blessed: you have money,"]],[6302,["you have everything, you have brains."]],[6304,["Everything is there. What is lacking is wisdom,"]],[6310,["with everything, with you. Supposing,"]],[6313,["you have a car."]],[6317,["You’re having a car, you have got keys,","you have got engine, you have brake,"]],[6323,["everything, but you don’t know how to drive, so what will happen?"]],[6331,["This is what it is."]],[6333,["So, as Sahaja Yogis from America,","you have a very, very, very special responsibility,"]],[6341,["very special responsibility."]],[6344,["Today we’ll be saying His hundred","and eight names which are well-done,"]],[6350,["have come from Poona all the way."]],[6353,["So that we’ll have it first and then a little Puja of the Devi."]],[6360,["May God bless you!"]]]);
